WEBVTT

00:08.520 --> 00:09.570
Here I go.

00:09.570 --> 00:10.480
Okay.

00:14.240 --> 00:15.700
And all done.

00:15.700 --> 00:17.490
Thank you, Wakatsuki.

00:17.700 --> 00:21.250
As I said before, this isn't magic,
but more of a charm.

00:21.660 --> 00:25.460
So it's not guaranteed that your
confession of love will be successful.

00:25.620 --> 00:26.830
I understand.

00:26.830 --> 00:31.510
It just makes me a bit more hopeful
if I receive a charm from a real witch.

00:31.710 --> 00:34.180
Thank you, I'm feeling
more courageous now.

00:34.380 --> 00:37.260
I hope everything goes well.

00:37.470 --> 00:39.510
Yeah! Thank you, Nico!

00:39.760 --> 00:41.770
Let me know when you get a boyfriend!

00:41.770 --> 00:42.680
Sure thing!

00:50.190 --> 00:52.440
A boyfriend, huh?

02:23.530 --> 02:27.080
UNDER THE LOVERS' TREE

02:30.750 --> 02:32.000
By the way, Nico...

02:32.330 --> 02:33.500
Huh? Y-Yes?

02:33.840 --> 02:35.050
How much do you weigh?

02:35.250 --> 02:36.210
Excuse me?!

02:36.510 --> 02:38.340
What? Why?

02:38.340 --> 02:40.590
You're 158 cm tall, right?

02:40.590 --> 02:42.800
As someone who manages your health,

02:42.800 --> 02:44.390
I feel it's necessary
to know your weight.

02:44.390 --> 02:45.260
I don't!

02:45.260 --> 02:48.850
Okay, listen Moi, you can't
ask a girl about her weight.

02:48.850 --> 02:50.270
But your health...

02:50.270 --> 02:52.610
It's not about that.

02:52.610 --> 02:55.770
Moi, please don't be so dense.

02:56.030 --> 03:01.280
Okay, I see. So for girls,
it's quite the delicate matter.

03:01.280 --> 03:03.530
I'm sorry, I'll be careful going forward.

03:04.200 --> 03:05.780
- It's Morihito.
- He's so cool.

03:05.780 --> 03:07.330
What a hottie.

03:07.330 --> 03:10.750
<i>I first noticed
when a small group was forming.</i>

03:11.080 --> 03:14.750
<i>That small group has started to grow,</i>

03:15.000 --> 03:18.010
<i>and will continue to stir up my heart.</i>

03:20.130 --> 03:23.760
<i>Moi is starting to get popular!</i>

03:24.930 --> 03:27.720
There are some pretty
dangerous things about him, too.

03:27.720 --> 03:28.970
What are you talking about?

03:35.610 --> 03:36.400
I'm ready.

03:36.650 --> 03:37.400
Hoi.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.120
You can catch them without seeing them?

03:45.120 --> 03:47.280
As long as I can visualize them, yeah.

03:47.660 --> 03:49.370
The slight sound and smell...

03:49.370 --> 03:51.710
I can sense them
when they flutter in the air.

03:51.910 --> 03:54.750
It's training for sharpening
my other senses besides sight.

03:56.170 --> 03:58.840
I think you should train
on sharpening a different sense.

03:58.840 --> 04:00.760
What? What do you mean?

04:00.760 --> 04:02.300
Nothing.

04:05.050 --> 04:07.180
<i>The fat makes it taste really great.</i>

04:07.180 --> 04:09.810
<i>Thank you.
Our steak is the customers'...</i>

04:07.560 --> 04:09.310
Hey, so I was wondering.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.640
You guys aren't dating?

04:16.150 --> 04:19.480
Your feelings are pretty obvious
just by watching you.

04:20.650 --> 04:24.110
You think so?
But Moi doesn't seem to get it.

04:24.110 --> 04:27.580
Well, he's a pretty strange guy
to begin with.

04:28.030 --> 04:32.450
Even when we're living together like this,
his routine hasn't changed at all.

04:32.870 --> 04:35.330
He goes to sleep and wakes up
at the same time every day,

04:35.330 --> 04:39.040
makes his coffee, and sits there and goes,
"Hmmph." What kind of ogre is that?

04:36.960 --> 04:41.050
HMMPH

04:39.340 --> 04:41.050
I mean, that should be okay, right?

04:41.710 --> 04:44.130
I just think you're wasted on him.

04:44.130 --> 04:47.970
You're cute, but you zone out all the time,
so you're not putting yourself out there.

04:46.470 --> 04:49.890
ZONE OUT

04:47.970 --> 04:50.220
Kan, can you please elaborate on that?

04:51.020 --> 04:53.350
What I'm trying to say is,
you have to be more obvious.

04:53.350 --> 04:55.230
<i>Raise your femininity with swaying hair.</i>

04:55.230 --> 04:56.230
<i>A commercial?</i>

04:56.230 --> 04:58.480
<i>For hair that'll flutter in the wind...</i>

04:58.650 --> 05:00.360
- This is it!
- What?

05:03.820 --> 05:05.740
We'll deploy this strategy
during lunch time.

05:05.950 --> 05:08.370
Okay, just like how
we planned it out last night.

05:08.740 --> 05:12.330
At lunch time, Morihito goes to the East Wing
where there's a vending machine.

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
That corridor will be our stage!

05:14.960 --> 05:20.840
<i>Their plan was to "flutter Nico's hair in the wind
so she can look like a beautiful woman."</i>

05:20.840 --> 05:22.760
<i>They aimed for the time when Morihito</i>

05:22.760 --> 05:25.170
<i>walks through the corridor
from the West Wing.</i>

05:25.170 --> 05:30.010
<i>Kanshi will hide in the courtyard, and blow wind
at Nico so her hair can flutter beautifully.</i>

05:26.050 --> 05:27.180
Fwoof!

05:30.800 --> 05:32.390
<i>Good luck!</i>

05:32.890 --> 05:34.890
<i>And now, the fated lunch time!</i>

05:39.940 --> 05:41.400
<i>Here he comes!</i>

05:41.610 --> 05:44.150
<i>Kan, now! "Send me wind."</i>

05:44.320 --> 05:47.280
There's the sign!
Okay, here we go. Armor-Piercing Gale!

06:03.050 --> 06:05.050
<i>Is the wind blowing?</i>

06:06.420 --> 06:07.760
That's great.

06:07.760 --> 06:11.010
Keep it up, Nico, you look beautiful!

06:11.140 --> 06:12.050
Peek.

06:13.850 --> 06:14.810
<i>Such dark eyes!</i>

06:15.100 --> 06:18.310
<i>This isn't working at all!
He's not even flinching.</i>

06:18.600 --> 06:21.310
<i>It needs to flutter
to make his heart flutter.</i>

06:21.980 --> 06:23.440
<i>"Stronger wind, please."</i>

06:23.650 --> 06:28.030
Oh, stronger? She's right,
this is probably not enough.

06:28.030 --> 06:31.870
All right, let's get you fluttering, Nico!

06:36.950 --> 06:38.710
Wh... Wh...

06:38.910 --> 06:40.960
What the heck?
The wind suddenly picked up.

06:41.170 --> 06:42.290
Wait, no it didn't!

06:42.290 --> 06:45.210
It's not blowing on me at all.
What the hell is going on?

06:45.340 --> 06:47.210
Oh, hey, Moi.

06:47.210 --> 06:48.880
What happened to you?

06:49.090 --> 06:51.300
Tell me. Do I... look beautiful?

06:51.300 --> 06:53.220
What? Did you say something?

06:57.560 --> 06:59.100
D-Did something happen to you?

06:59.100 --> 07:01.400
Oh, you teach the health classes.

07:01.400 --> 07:02.860
Say, do I look beautiful?

07:02.860 --> 07:04.480
Have you fallen ill?

07:04.820 --> 07:07.400
Huh? There's only wind blowing here?

07:07.610 --> 07:09.610
The papers for everyone's
body measurements.

07:09.610 --> 07:10.240
What?

07:10.240 --> 07:11.910
Those are the girls' files, too!

07:11.910 --> 07:14.950
What?!

07:27.300 --> 07:28.880
I did not look at a single one.

07:30.170 --> 07:30.930
Amazing!

07:30.930 --> 07:32.010
So cool!

07:32.010 --> 07:34.010
- Who's that?
- Otogi from Class 1-3!

07:37.390 --> 07:40.100
And his popularity rises even higher.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.480
<i>Afterwards, they were scolded harshly.</i>

07:42.480 --> 07:44.940
What? Make it flutter to make me flutter?

07:44.940 --> 07:46.770
At least try to make some sense.

07:48.650 --> 07:51.150
Oh, Otogi, see you later!

07:51.150 --> 07:52.360
Yeah, see ya.

07:52.660 --> 07:53.700
Who was that?

07:53.860 --> 07:57.790
Moi, you pulled off a cool stunt, so your
popularity skyrocketed. Isn't that great?

07:58.660 --> 08:00.160
Not really.

08:00.160 --> 08:01.500
It doesn't make you happy?

08:01.500 --> 08:03.540
It's not like it doesn't make me happy,

08:04.250 --> 08:07.840
but when a stranger calls out to me,
it leaves me perplexed.

08:07.840 --> 08:10.970
I've always concentrated on training,
so I didn't have that many friends.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.720
So it's a good thing after all.

08:29.400 --> 08:31.070
Um, Wakatsuki?

08:31.780 --> 08:33.200
Can I talk to you for a second?

08:34.410 --> 08:36.320
You're meeting up with a guy?

08:36.530 --> 08:38.830
Yeah, his name is Ishii.

08:38.830 --> 08:41.370
He asked if we could talk
during lunch time on our field trip.

08:41.370 --> 08:43.080
That's definitely a confession of love!

08:43.330 --> 08:46.330
It can't be. I mean, I don't
even know the person at all.

08:46.330 --> 08:50.590
Ugh, this princess
doesn't get it all, does she?

08:50.920 --> 08:55.090
Listen. Right now, Witch Girl Nico
is the talk of the town.

08:55.090 --> 08:58.220
She can use magic! She has a bright
and friendly personality!

08:58.220 --> 08:59.600
And on top of that, she's cute!

09:00.560 --> 09:01.970
Kara, are you drunk?

09:01.970 --> 09:04.850
And when it comes to field trips,
there's always "that."

09:04.850 --> 09:05.600
What's "that"?

09:06.560 --> 09:11.570
The Asunaro High School specialty,
Mt. Futatsu's Off-Season Flowering Sacred Fig Tree.

09:11.570 --> 09:14.070
I don't get it at all,
so Kuku, can you explain?

09:14.070 --> 09:16.160
Mt. Futatsu, where we'll be going
on our field trip,

09:16.160 --> 09:18.990
has a tree that's famous
for being a lovers' tree.

09:18.990 --> 09:20.990
There's a saying that
when two people get together

09:20.990 --> 09:24.500
at that tree and eat lunch under it,
then those two will start dating.

09:25.960 --> 09:28.250
So a lovers' tree, huh?

09:28.420 --> 09:32.380
It's also just a good chance to confess
your love to someone. Boring!

09:36.220 --> 09:37.470
Real boring.

09:37.470 --> 09:39.890
Kara desperately wants to be in love.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.390
It's definitely a good chance.

09:44.600 --> 09:46.230
You should tell Morihito how you feel.

09:47.350 --> 09:49.310
On the day of the field trip? To Moi?

09:49.310 --> 09:52.570
No, no, no,
MURI, MURI, MURI!

09:52.570 --> 09:53.530
You're like Dio.

09:53.530 --> 09:57.860
You help other people with their love lives,
but you won't do anything about yours?

09:59.990 --> 10:03.660
I don't think I'm the type of girl
who Moi would care about.

10:03.950 --> 10:07.790
I'm always messing up, so I might be
like a little sister to him.

10:08.370 --> 10:11.710
So I thought that I should focus
my efforts on my training.

10:11.710 --> 10:15.550
Until I become a proper witch,
I probably don't have time for love.

10:15.710 --> 10:17.090
Are you in a sports club?

10:17.880 --> 10:21.550
Why are you talking like you're in one?
You can't fool me!

10:21.550 --> 10:24.890
"I'm concentrating on my sport
so my love life will have to come after."

10:24.890 --> 10:26.480
You're just running away!

10:27.100 --> 10:30.980
I'm seriously scared of confessing
my love. Please help me, Kan!

10:31.520 --> 10:35.480
What happened last time really made me
realize that Moi has no interest in me.

10:35.480 --> 10:38.320
I tried my best to appeal to him,
but his eyes were so dark.

10:38.740 --> 10:42.070
I've never seen such eyes
that not even light can reflect off of it.

10:42.370 --> 10:46.580
Well, I also bugged him about it one time.

10:46.830 --> 10:48.000
And then he said...

10:48.000 --> 10:51.080
<i>We're Nico's familiars, and we're
supposed to be protecting her.</i>

10:51.630 --> 10:55.340
<i>If the bodyguard has special feelings towards
the client, it'll get in the way of their job.</i>

10:55.920 --> 10:57.090
His eyes were so black.

10:57.090 --> 11:00.260
When did you have
such a conversation? Stop it, Kan.

11:00.260 --> 11:02.090
His mentality is also strong, too.

11:02.760 --> 11:05.220
Add that to his super serious personality.

11:05.220 --> 11:06.770
Since his sense of responsibility
is too strong,

11:06.770 --> 11:10.140
he probably told himself that he can't
look at you in a romantic way.

11:10.140 --> 11:11.270
But...

11:11.270 --> 11:14.730
he definitely thinks of you
as someone who's precious.

11:14.980 --> 11:17.940
Well, that's because
he's my familiar, right?

11:17.940 --> 11:20.700
No, without realizing it, I think

11:20.700 --> 11:24.070
he's masking his true feelings
with the sense of responsibility.

11:24.280 --> 11:27.370
And that's why we have to shake him up
from this side.

11:36.250 --> 11:38.840
Everyone, climb at your own pace, okay?

11:38.840 --> 11:40.420
There's no need to rush.

11:40.420 --> 11:44.550
If you go at your speed, you can
even see the scenery around you.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.560
- What's she saying now?
- Maybe something inspiring?

11:46.560 --> 11:48.140
It's not really making any sense though.

11:48.140 --> 11:51.770
<i>Ms. Makuwa, U.M.'s famous line said
by Commander Fuwa is seeping out of you.</i>

11:53.100 --> 11:55.770
Let's talk while we climb, Moi.

11:59.490 --> 12:00.320
Sure.

12:04.200 --> 12:06.280
You got invited over to the lovers' tree?

12:06.490 --> 12:08.040
Y-Yeah.

12:09.080 --> 12:10.160
I see.

12:10.450 --> 12:14.750
<i>As poker-faced as ever.
Is this really shaking him up?</i>

12:15.290 --> 12:18.750
All right. I won't be around you
as your guard during that time.

12:18.750 --> 12:20.670
I'll step away,
so feel free to do as you wish.

12:20.880 --> 12:23.130
That's not what I'm trying to get at.

12:23.130 --> 12:26.800
A-Are you fine with me
being confessed to from another guy?

12:27.390 --> 12:28.810
It's fine with me.

12:30.680 --> 12:32.480
Even if I get a boyfriend?

12:34.940 --> 12:37.440
Listen, Nico. I'm happy for you.

12:38.110 --> 12:41.610
You're getting to enjoy your life
not as a witch,

12:41.610 --> 12:44.030
but as an ordinary high school girl.

12:45.740 --> 12:48.700
School is already fun for me right now.

12:49.370 --> 12:51.250
It's really fun.

12:52.830 --> 12:56.960
I'm not the little girl who got bullied
when we were kids anymore.

13:22.820 --> 13:24.110
A target mark?

13:27.360 --> 13:28.870
Is that the Air Force mark?

13:30.160 --> 13:34.000
I mean, it's me we're talking about here,
so it has to be the logo of a band.

13:34.460 --> 13:35.960
I'm sure you've never heard of it,

13:35.960 --> 13:40.000
but within rock history, they're a band
that's as famous as the Beatles and the Stones.

13:40.380 --> 13:41.550
The guitarist mentioned

13:41.550 --> 13:45.720
the original work of an autobiography-type
rock opera that ended up becoming a movie,

13:45.720 --> 13:47.340
and I was more interested in...

13:47.340 --> 13:51.560
I know about them. It's an extremely
important piece within the Mod subculture.

13:52.350 --> 13:55.520
But I took you
for more of a Rocker subculture guy.

13:55.770 --> 13:57.270
That's not true.

13:57.270 --> 14:00.020
I used to go around antique clothing shops
because I seriously wanted

14:00.480 --> 14:02.530
an M-51 fishtail parka.

14:04.280 --> 14:07.280
I'm Morihito Otogi.
We're in the same class.

14:07.660 --> 14:09.240
Keigo Magami.

14:09.240 --> 14:13.290
I also post videos about anything subculture
related, so check it out when you can.

14:24.380 --> 14:26.050
Let's eat over there.

14:26.380 --> 14:27.420
And you are?

14:29.130 --> 14:31.800
Hey, Otogi, can I talk to you for a second?

14:32.390 --> 14:35.560
Let's see, is the lovers' tree over here?

14:36.640 --> 14:39.650
<i>I have to properly turn down Ishii.</i>

14:40.770 --> 14:41.980
There it is!

14:41.980 --> 14:43.690
Whoa, there's so many people!

14:44.820 --> 14:46.110
This is kinda scary!

14:46.110 --> 14:48.070
This place is filled with so many
enthusiastic students.

14:48.070 --> 14:50.700
I feel like I wandered into a shady area.

14:50.700 --> 14:53.910
TAKAGI
YOSHIDA
WATANABE
SATONAKA, OVER HERE
KIYOMIZU

14:51.070 --> 14:53.910
It looks like an airport's arrival area.

14:54.120 --> 14:56.250
I have to find Ishii.

14:56.250 --> 14:57.910
Wakatsuki, over here!

14:57.910 --> 14:59.040
Oh, there you are.

14:59.040 --> 15:01.000
Thanks for coming all this way.

15:00.580 --> 15:02.170
NICO WAKATSUKI PARTY

15:01.000 --> 15:02.170
There's more?

15:02.330 --> 15:05.630
What's going on?
It's like we're in a tour group.

15:05.630 --> 15:09.430
Sorry. When I told them I'd be meeting you,
they all wanted to come.

15:09.720 --> 15:12.680
What? All these people
want to confess their love to me?

15:12.680 --> 15:15.890
Please give us a love charm!

15:15.890 --> 15:17.020
Oh, that?

15:17.020 --> 15:20.600
I'm so embarrassed. Wait, why
do you want that charm here?

15:20.600 --> 15:23.810
Because if we receive hope under
the hopeful tree, that's two times the hope!

15:23.810 --> 15:24.610
No, it's not!

15:24.770 --> 15:27.150
That's not how this works!
Who spread such a rumor?

15:27.150 --> 15:28.530
It has nothing to do with it.

15:28.530 --> 15:30.280
I heard your love life will be fulfilled.

15:30.280 --> 15:31.910
I heard you can become
a handsome guy with magic!

15:31.910 --> 15:34.740
I heard you can find
quintuplets as fiancées!

15:35.030 --> 15:38.250
These rumors are becoming
more bizarre than ever.

15:38.540 --> 15:41.080
I can't take responsibility for this!

15:41.080 --> 15:43.000
- She's getting away!
- Please wait!

15:43.000 --> 15:46.210
No, no, no,
MURI, MURI, MURI!

15:46.210 --> 15:49.010
I gotta hide somewhere. Ensmallen!

15:51.260 --> 15:52.930
Huh? She disappeared.

15:52.930 --> 15:54.760
- That's strange.
- Please come out!

15:54.760 --> 15:56.890
- Where did she go?
- I don't see her!

15:58.890 --> 16:00.640
Okay, time to escape!

16:02.440 --> 16:03.900
I'm so tired.

16:03.900 --> 16:06.940
And I wanted to eat lunch with Moi, too.

16:08.150 --> 16:08.900
Ouch!

16:13.280 --> 16:16.240
Oopsie, whose pocket did I fall into?

16:16.450 --> 16:18.200
It's Moi!

16:18.200 --> 16:21.160
You brought me all the way
out here. What do you want?

16:19.700 --> 16:21.160
He's talking with someone?

16:21.460 --> 16:24.790
<i>A girl! And she's fidgeting!
Wait, is this...</i>

16:24.790 --> 16:26.420
Otogi.

16:26.880 --> 16:29.210
Would you like to go out with me?

16:29.210 --> 16:30.800
<i>Moi is in the middle of being confessed to!</i>

16:33.880 --> 16:35.010
<i>Moi.</i>

16:37.850 --> 16:39.430
<i>What answer will you give her?</i>

16:39.810 --> 16:41.600
But I don't know who you are at all.

16:41.600 --> 16:45.310
Yeah, but I've seen you before
at the train station.

16:46.360 --> 16:48.480
You were helping out an old lady.

16:51.690 --> 16:53.700
I'm grateful for your affection.

16:55.110 --> 16:57.320
But I don't feel the same way about you.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.950
It's because I don't know
anything about you.

17:00.160 --> 17:01.450
So it should be obvious.

17:01.870 --> 17:04.830
<i>Girls are gonna get hurt
if you say it so bluntly.</i>

17:05.250 --> 17:07.670
Wow, you're so cool
when you say it so bluntly.

17:07.670 --> 17:09.250
<i>She's on fire now!</i>

17:09.590 --> 17:12.130
You don't have a girlfriend, right?

17:12.260 --> 17:12.880
Right.

17:15.090 --> 17:18.100
Then, is there someone you love?

17:20.310 --> 17:22.810
Someone I love...

17:25.940 --> 17:26.600
No.

17:34.820 --> 17:36.030
I don't, but...

17:37.200 --> 17:38.780
There's someone precious to me.

17:39.660 --> 17:43.200
<i>...he definitely thinks of you
as someone who's precious.</i>

17:46.290 --> 17:50.290
She gets herself in danger a lot,
and she came to me for help.

17:50.630 --> 17:54.630
I want to be there for her, so my time
is full enough with that responsibility.

17:55.130 --> 17:58.260
Precious? Is that different
compared to love?

17:59.930 --> 18:01.010
I never thought about that.

18:03.390 --> 18:06.640
I don't think
it's a difficult thing to think about.

18:06.640 --> 18:08.270
Try envisioning that person in your head.

18:08.270 --> 18:13.190
Was there a moment in the past
when you fell in love with her?

18:14.490 --> 18:16.820
<i>The moment you fell in love.</i>

18:19.280 --> 18:20.990
<i>There was one for me.</i>

18:27.580 --> 18:29.290
Did you get bullied again?

18:30.960 --> 18:32.170
Moi.

18:32.630 --> 18:35.920
No. My dad left us.

18:36.630 --> 18:40.390
My mom and my dad weren't really
getting along to begin with,

18:40.390 --> 18:44.930
and I was told it's hard for a normal human
and a witch to be a family.

18:45.270 --> 18:46.640
What happened?

18:54.280 --> 18:58.200
My magic power got too big
and then went "boom!"

18:58.740 --> 19:03.280
These powers are going to make people
hate me even more.

19:03.780 --> 19:06.080
And I really liked Daddy, too.

19:06.080 --> 19:09.370
I wanted him to pick me up
and carry me around a lot more.

19:16.510 --> 19:18.880
I'm strong, you know.

19:25.140 --> 19:27.560
Thank you, Moi.

19:41.860 --> 19:43.280
I thought of a moment.

19:51.960 --> 19:54.960
I'm hungry.
I guess I'll eat lunch by myself.

19:55.340 --> 19:57.250
Hrrm! The spell is about to wear off.

19:57.630 --> 20:00.260
It's close to bursting!
I can't get back to my normal size here.

20:00.970 --> 20:02.720
Like a bat out of hell!

20:04.510 --> 20:07.140
Oopsie. Oh, no! I'm gonna turn back!

20:11.390 --> 20:12.480
Nico?

20:27.580 --> 20:30.250
What are you doing here?

20:31.540 --> 20:33.500
Just practicing my magic.

20:37.710 --> 20:39.130
Moi.

20:39.960 --> 20:41.380
Aren't I heavy?

20:43.880 --> 20:45.800
I'm strong, you know.

20:48.600 --> 20:50.890
Hey! Get the hell off the tree!

20:52.100 --> 20:53.770
Whoa, sorry about that.

20:53.940 --> 20:58.360
If you want to climb high places,
you should keep chasing your dreams.

20:58.360 --> 21:00.150
A strange old man suddenly appears.

21:00.530 --> 21:02.240
Are you one of the students
from the field trip?

21:02.240 --> 21:06.160
Everyone's eating lunch over there,
so what're you doing here?

21:06.160 --> 21:10.080
Oh, I heard there's a lovers' tree
over there, so there's nothing but couples

21:10.080 --> 21:12.330
and I was getting irritated.

21:12.330 --> 21:16.330
You know, legends and rumors
are things that change along the way.

21:16.330 --> 21:18.290
Huh? Is he starting a lecture?

21:18.500 --> 21:20.090
Because of its impressiveness,

21:20.090 --> 21:25.130
it looks like that sacred fig tree
became known as the lovers' tree.

21:25.130 --> 21:27.010
But that's not the real one.

21:27.010 --> 21:31.140
What? Why would an old man
know about young people's rumors?

21:31.140 --> 21:34.560
Oh George, there you are. Let's go home.

21:35.770 --> 21:40.980
The real legend is if you and your crush eat lunch
under that small, boring konara oak tree,

21:40.980 --> 21:42.400
then they'll become a couple.

21:42.400 --> 21:46.200
And we know that because we're the ones
who first spread that rumor.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.700
So I guarantee it.

21:48.280 --> 21:49.830
That boring tree over there?

21:52.620 --> 21:54.080
Hey, Kanshi.

21:54.410 --> 21:55.960
Did you see Nico anywhere?

21:55.960 --> 21:58.290
She went off somewhere
and we can't find her.

21:58.290 --> 22:00.590
Oh, she's definitely not over here.

22:00.750 --> 22:03.670
How about we go that way?
Let's all eat lunch under that tree.

22:03.670 --> 22:04.970
Are you going to confess your love to me?

22:04.970 --> 22:05.720
No way!

22:06.180 --> 22:09.220
That legend, you see, is actually...

23:57.750 --> 24:01.120
In order to make Moi love me, I have
no other choice but to use hypnosis.

24:01.120 --> 24:02.080
Hypnosis?

24:02.080 --> 24:04.340
Kan, keep your eyes on this five yen coin.

24:04.340 --> 24:05.840
You will start to fall in love with Nico.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.210
You will start to fall in love with Nico.

24:07.210 --> 24:09.050
I love myself!

24:08.380 --> 24:11.970
NEXT EPISODE
KAN & NICO'S CHANNEL
THE TEA CEREMONY
IS A PIECE OF TEA CAKE

24:09.050 --> 24:10.170
I think I'm really cute!

24:10.170 --> 24:11.970
You got caught by it?
